**Effective Capacity:** 26.1 points

---

## Sprint Goal

Enable new administrators and power users to achieve their first meaningful value within the onboarding flow through a guided checklist and actionable dashboard, while ensuring accessibility for all users.

---

## Team Capacity Planning

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Base Velocity | 29 points |
| Availability Factor | 0.9 |
| Effective Capacity | 26.1 points |
| Max Committed (85%) | 22.2 points |
| Buffer Required (10%) | 2.6 points |

---

## Committed Stories (18 points)

These stories are committed to delivery within the sprint, respecting the 85% capacity constraint.

### High Priority (10 points)

| ID | Title | Points | Persona |
|----|-------|--------|---------|
| ONB-101 | Welcome checklist for new administrators | 5 | Administrator |
| ONB-102 | Dashboard highlights with key metrics | 5 | Power User |

### Medium Priority (6 points)

| ID | Title | Points | Persona |
|----|-------|--------|---------|
| ONB-103 | Keyboard-accessible onboarding navigation | 3 | New User |
| ONB-104 | Export onboarding progress as PDF | 3 | Administrator |

### Low Priority (2 points)

| ID | Title | Points | Persona |
|----|-------|--------|---------|
| ONB-105 | Contextual help tooltips on setup screens | 2 | New User |

**Total Committed:** 18 points (69% of effective capacity)  
**Remaining Buffer:** 8.1 points (31% of effective capacity)

---

## Stretch Goals

If capacity allows, consider the following stretch work:

1. **Performance Optimization:** Reduce dashboard load time to under 1 second for premium users
2. **Analytics Integration:** Add tracking for onboarding completion rates
3. **Mobile Responsiveness:** Ensure onboarding flow works on tablet devices

---

## Dependencies & Risks

### Dependencies

- ONB-104 (PDF Export) depends on ONB-101 (Welcome Checklist) completion

### Risks

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| PDF generation library integration issues | Early spike on PDF library selection |
| Accessibility compliance gaps | Engage accessibility specialist for review |
| Dashboard performance with large datasets | Implement pagination and lazy loading |

---

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Code complete and reviewed
- [ ] Unit tests passing (minimum 80% coverage)
- [ ] Acceptance criteria verified
- [ ] Accessibility requirements met (WCAG 2.1 AA)
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Product Owner acceptance

---

## Sprint Timeline (10 Days)

| Day | Focus |
|-----|-------|
| 1-2 | Sprint planning, spike on PDF library, ONB-101 development |
| 3-4 | ONB-101 completion, ONB-102 development begins |
| 5-6 | ONB-102 development, ONB-103 accessibility implementation |
| 7-8 | ONB-103 completion, ONB-104 PDF export development |
| 9 | ONB-105 tooltips, integration testing |
| 10 | Final testing, demo preparation, retrospective |

---

*Generated for Product Owner Review*  
*Marker: PO-MARKER-7F3A*
"""

