epic_breakdown = """# Epic Breakdown: Customer Onboarding and First-Success Dashboard

**Marker:** PO-MARKER-7F3A

---

## Epic Overview

### Epic Name
Customer onboarding and first-success dashboard

### Business Goal
Reduce time-to-first-value for new administrators and power users

### Stakeholders
- Admin users
- Power users
- New users

---

## Story Breakdown

### Story Map

Story Hierarchy:
- Must Have (High Priority - 10 pts)
  - ONB-101: Welcome checklist for new administrators (5 pts)
  - ONB-102: Dashboard highlights with key metrics (5 pts)
- Should Have (Medium Priority - 6 pts)
  - ONB-103: Keyboard-accessible onboarding navigation (3 pts)
  - ONB-104: Export onboarding progress as PDF (3 pts)
- Could Have (Low Priority - 2 pts)
  - ONB-105: Contextual help tooltips on setup screens (2 pts)

---

## Dependency Graph

ONB-101 (Welcome Checklist)
    |
    +--> ONB-104 (PDF Export)

ONB-102 (Dashboard) - Independent

ONB-103 (Keyboard Nav) - Independent

ONB-105 (Tooltips) - Independent

### Detailed Dependencies

| Story ID | Depends On | Reason |
|----------|------------|--------|
| ONB-101 | None | Foundation story - no dependencies |
| ONB-102 | None | Independent feature |
| ONB-103 | None | Independent accessibility feature |
| ONB-104 | ONB-101 | PDF export requires checklist data to export |
| ONB-105 | None | Independent enhancement |

---

## Story Investment Analysis

| Story | Points | Priority | Effort/Value Ratio |
|-------|--------|----------|-------------------|
| ONB-101 | 5 | High | Excellent (core onboarding) |
| ONB-102 | 5 | High | Excellent (key visibility) |
| ONB-103 | 3 | Medium | Good (accessibility requirement) |
| ONB-104 | 3 | Medium | Moderate (nice-to-have export) |
| ONB-105 | 2 | Low | Good (low effort, incremental value) |

Total Investment: 18 story points

---

## Delivery Phases

### Phase 1: Core Onboarding (Days 1-5)
- Stories: ONB-101, ONB-102
- Goal: Enable administrators to complete setup and power users to see key metrics
- Points: 10

### Phase 2: Accessibility and Sharing (Days 6-8)
- Stories: ONB-103, ONB-104
- Goal: Ensure accessibility compliance and enable progress sharing
- Points: 6

### Phase 3: Polish and Enhancement (Days 9-10)
- Stories: ONB-105
- Goal: Add contextual help to reduce support burden
- Points: 2

---

## Success Metrics

| Metric | Target | Measurement Method |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| Time to first value | Less than 30 minutes | Analytics tracking |
| Onboarding completion rate | Greater than 80 percent | Completion funnel analysis |
| Support tickets reduction | -25 percent | Support ticket comparison |
| Accessibility compliance | WCAG 2.1 AA | Automated plus manual audit |

---

## Notes for Product Owner

1. Priority Rationale: High-priority stories (ONB-101, ONB-102) address the core business goal of reducing time-to-first-value
2. Dependency Management: ONB-104 should not be started until ONB-101 is in progress
3. Capacity Buffer: Current plan uses 69 percent of effective capacity, leaving 31 percent buffer for unforeseen work
4. All stories are INVEST-compliant and have testable acceptance criteria

---

Generated for Product Owner Review
Marker: PO-MARKER-7F3A
"""

with open('/workspace/epic_breakdown.md', 'w') as f:
